msgid ""
"The WallpaperSource folder of Razer Axon: …/AppData/Local/Razer/RazerAxon/"
"WallpaperSource inside the Wine prefix where Razer Axon is installed."
msgstr ""
"Razer Axon 的 WallpaperSource 文件夹：位于安装了 Razer Axon 的 Wine 前缀中的 "
"…/AppData/Local/Razer/RazerAxon/WallpaperSource。"

