"No Razer Axon wallpapers in this folder. Choose the WallpaperSource folder "
"(…/AppData/Local/Razer/RazerAxon/WallpaperSource)."
msgstr ""
"此文件夹中没有 Razer Axon 壁纸。请选择 WallpaperSource 文件夹（…/AppData/"
