msgstr "已添加 Razer Axon 文件夹：找到壁纸 %1 个。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid "Prepare wallpapers in advance"
msgstr "提前准备壁纸"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon decrypts downloaded Razer Axon wallpapers in the background, right in "
"the Razer Axon library, so that “Apply” starts at once. Razer Axon keeps "
"showing them."
msgstr ""
"Rexon 会在后台直接在 Razer Axon 库中解密已下载的 Razer Axon 壁纸，使“应用”能"
"立即生效。Razer Axon 仍可照常显示它们。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 and %2 are numbers of Razer Axon wallpapers.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid "Prepared: %1, remaining: %2."
msgstr "已准备：%1，剩余：%2。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid "Preparing in the background…"
msgstr "正在后台准备…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid "Restore original descriptions"
msgstr "恢复原始描述"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid ""
"The original ResourceConfig.txt files saved before preparation will be put "
"back. The wallpaper files themselves are already decrypted: unless the "
"encrypted originals were kept, Razer Axon will not show these wallpapers "
"with the restored descriptions until you download them again. Preparing in "
"advance will be turned off."
msgstr ""
"将放回准备前保存的原始 ResourceConfig.txt 文件。壁纸文件本身已被解密：除非保"
"留了加密的原文件，否则在重新下载之前，Razer Axon 无法凭恢复的描述显示这些壁"
"纸。提前准备功能将被关闭。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid "Restore descriptions"
msgstr "恢复描述"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid "No saved descriptions to restore."
msgstr "没有可恢复的已保存描述。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 — descriptions restored, %2 — of them together with the
#. original encrypted file, %3 — failures.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_prepare.rs
msgid "Descriptions restored: %1 (with original files: %2). Failed: %3."
msgstr "已恢复描述：%1（含原始文件：%2）。失败：%3。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/axon_window.rs
msgid ""
"Wallpapers you downloaded in Razer Axon on this computer. Rexon shows them "
"itself: Razer Axon doesn't have to be running."
msgstr ""
"在这台电脑上用 Razer Axon 下载的壁纸。Rexon 会自己显示它们：无需运行 Razer "
"Axon。"

