msgstr "小部件未启动：它需要 Conky 程序。请再次点击“%1”并输入密码进行安装。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/de_apply.rs
msgid "Couldn't install Conky: %1. The widget wasn't started."
msgstr "无法安装 Conky：%1。小部件未启动。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/de_apply.rs
