#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "🛠 Rebuild from Arch sources"
msgstr "🛠 从 Arch 源代码重新构建"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"The official Arch recipe, built on your computer in a few minutes. When Arch "
"releases its own rebuild, it will come with the regular update."
msgstr ""
"使用 Arch 官方构建脚本，在你的电脑上几分钟即可构建完成。Arch 发布自己的重新构"
"建版本后，会随常规更新到来。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"Nothing needs rebuilding any more: the packages have changed since the card "
"was opened."
msgstr "已无需重新构建：自打开此卡片以来软件包已发生变化。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "Rebuilding %1 from Arch sources"
msgstr "正在从 Arch 源代码重新构建 %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"%1 in the repository was built against an older version of a library (%2), "
"so it can't be installed until Arch rebuilds it.\n"
"\n"
"Rexon can build it right now with the official Arch recipe: the recipe is "
"downloaded from gitlab.archlinux.org, the sources are checked against its "
"checksums and signatures, and the build runs on your computer without "
"administrator rights. The password is asked once. If the build takes longer "
"than a few minutes, it may be asked once more before installing.\n"
"\n"
"When Arch releases its own rebuild, it will replace this one with the "
"regular update."
msgstr ""
"软件仓库中的 %1 是针对旧版本的库（%2）构建的，因此在 Arch 重新构建之前无法安"
"装。\n"
"\n"
"Rexon 现在就可以用 Arch 官方构建脚本构建它：脚本从 gitlab.archlinux.org 下"
"载，源代码会按其中的校验和与签名进行核对，构建在你的电脑上进行，无需管理员权"
"限。只需输入一次密码；如果构建耗时超过几分钟，安装前可能会再询问一次。\n"
"\n"
"Arch 发布自己的重新构建版本后，会随常规更新替换此版本。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "📥 Downloading the official Arch recipe for %1…"
msgstr "📥 正在下载 %1 的 Arch 官方构建脚本…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "The recipe for version %2 of %1 wasn't found; taking its latest state."
msgstr "未找到 %1 版本 %2 的构建脚本，将使用其最新状态。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "The recipe is for version %1, the repository has %2."
msgstr "构建脚本对应版本 %1，软件仓库中为 %2。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "📦 Installing what the build needs: %1"
msgstr "📦 正在安装构建所需的软件包：%1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "🔑 Getting the signing key %1 to check the sources…"
msgstr "🔑 正在获取签名密钥 %1 以校验源代码…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "🔨 Building %1 — this usually takes a few minutes…"
msgstr "🔨 正在构建 %1——通常需要几分钟…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "📦 Installing the rebuilt %1…"
msgstr "📦 正在安装重新构建的 %1…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"%1 was rebuilt from Arch sources and installed. When Arch releases its own "
"rebuild, it will come with the regular update."
msgstr ""
"%1 已从 Arch 源代码重新构建并安装。Arch 发布自己的重新构建版本后，会随常规更"
"新到来。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"Rebuilding from sources is only available on Arch Linux and its derivatives "
"with a writable system."
msgstr "仅在系统可写的 Arch Linux 及其衍生发行版上才能从源代码重新构建。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"The program %1 is missing, so the package can't be built. Install it and try "
"again."
msgstr "缺少程序 %1，无法构建软件包。请安装后重试。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "%1 wasn't found in the repositories."
msgstr "软件仓库中未找到 %1。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't download the build recipe for %1 from gitlab.archlinux.org. Check "
"your internet connection and try again."
msgstr "无法从 gitlab.archlinux.org 下载 %1 的构建脚本。请检查网络连接后重试。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "The build recipe for %1 can't be read."
msgstr "无法读取 %1 的构建脚本。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't find out what the build needs: the package manager didn't answer."
msgstr "无法确定构建所需内容：软件包管理器无响应。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't install what the build needs (%1). Details are in the log above."
msgstr "无法安装构建所需的软件包（%1）。详细信息见上方日志。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't get the signing key %1, so the sources can't be checked. The build "
"was stopped: Rexon doesn't build unchecked sources."
msgstr ""
"无法获取签名密钥 %1，因此无法校验源代码。构建已停止：Rexon 不构建未经校验的源"
"代码。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"The downloaded sources don't match the checksums in the recipe — they may "
"have been changed on the way. Nothing was installed."
msgstr ""
"下载的源代码与构建脚本中的校验和不符——可能在传输途中被篡改。未安装任何内容。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"The signature of the sources couldn't be confirmed. Nothing was installed."
msgstr "无法确认源代码的签名。未安装任何内容。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid ""
"A source file couldn't be downloaded. Check your internet connection and try "
"again."
msgstr "无法下载源代码文件。请检查网络连接后重试。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "The build stopped with an error."
msgstr "构建因错误而停止。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "Building %1 failed. %2"
msgstr "构建 %1 失败。%2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "Full build log: %1"
msgstr "完整构建日志：%1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "The build finished, but the package file for %1 wasn't found."
msgstr "构建已完成，但未找到 %1 的软件包文件。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/repo_rebuild.rs
msgid "The rebuilt %1 couldn't be installed. Details are in the log above."
msgstr "无法安装重新构建的 %1。详细信息见上方日志。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "This package needs %1, and it is not installed."
msgstr "此软件包需要 %1，但它未安装。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "This package cannot be installed while %1 is installed."
msgstr "已安装 %1 时无法安装此软件包。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "%1 is provided here by %2, and this package does not work with it."
msgstr "此处由 %2 提供 %1，而此软件包无法与之配合使用。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"the package uses format version %1, this Rexon reads up to %2 — update Rexon"
msgstr "软件包使用格式版本 %1，此 Rexon 最多只能读取到 %2——请更新 Rexon"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "manifest.json does not match format 5: %1"
msgstr "manifest.json 不符合格式 5：%1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"the Steam app id must not be stored in the package: Rexon knows it itself"
msgstr "软件包中不得存储 Steam 应用 ID（app id）：Rexon 自己知道它"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"id '%1' may only contain Latin letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-' and must "
"not start with '.' or '-'"
msgstr ""
"id '%1' 只能包含拉丁字母、数字、'.'、'_' 和 '-'，且不能以 '.' 或 '-' 开头"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the package needs a name"
msgstr "软件包需要名称"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the package has no items"
msgstr "软件包中没有任何项目"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a precondition needs owners, not_owners or installed"
msgstr "前提条件需要指定 owners、not_owners 或 installed"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the explanation is empty"
msgstr "说明为空"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "cannot read the version requirement '%1' (expected e.g. '>=6.0')"
msgstr "无法解析版本要求 '%1'（应为类似 '>=6.0' 的格式）"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a pinned source needs an id: items refer to its files as sources/<id>/…"
msgstr "固定的来源需要 id：项目以 sources/<id>/… 引用其文件"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "source id '%1' may only contain Latin letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-'"
msgstr "来源 id '%1' 只能包含拉丁字母、数字、'.'、'_' 和 '-'"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "source id '%1' is used twice"
msgstr "来源 id '%1' 被使用了两次"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"a source with an id needs exactly one of: rev (git commit), sha256 (archive) "
"or package (dependency role)"
msgstr ""
"带 id 的来源必须且只能指定以下之一：rev（git 提交）、sha256（压缩包）或 "
"package（依赖角色）"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "rev must be a full git commit hash, not a branch or a tag"
msgstr "rev 必须是完整的 git 提交哈希，不能是分支或标签"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "sha256 must be 64 hexadecimal characters"
msgstr "sha256 必须为 64 个十六进制字符"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a downloaded source needs an https:// address"
msgstr "需下载的来源必须使用 https:// 地址"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "no dependency with the role '%1' in requires.packages"
msgstr "requires.packages 中没有角色为 '%1' 的依赖"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "source '%1' needs its license"
msgstr "来源 '%1' 需要注明许可证"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "path '%1' refers to a source that is not declared in sources"
msgstr "路径 '%1' 引用了未在 sources 中声明的来源"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "'%1' is not a valid consumer name"
msgstr "'%1' 不是有效的使用方名称"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "property names may only contain Latin letters, digits and '_'"
msgstr "属性名只能包含拉丁字母、数字和 '_'"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a list property needs options"
msgstr "列表属性需要选项"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "option '%1' is listed twice"
msgstr "选项 '%1' 被列出了两次"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the option label is empty"
msgstr "选项标签为空"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a slider needs numeric min < max and a numeric default"
msgstr "滑块需要数值 min < max 以及数值型默认值"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the default value does not fit the property type"
msgstr "默认值与属性类型不符"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "unknown property '%1'"
msgstr "未知属性 '%1'"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "expected a value or a list of values"
msgstr "应为一个值或值列表"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a condition can only test a list or toggle property"
msgstr "条件只能检测列表或开关属性"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "'%1' is not a value of property '%2'"
msgstr "'%1' 不是属性 '%2' 的取值"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "unknown item kind '%1'"
msgstr "未知项目类型 '%1'"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a reference item needs the id of a Steam Workshop item"
msgstr "引用项目需要 Steam 创意工坊物品的 id"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the item has neither its own files nor a description to build them from"
msgstr "该项目既没有自己的文件，也没有可用于构建文件的描述"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "generation is forbidden, but the item has no files of its own"
msgstr "已禁止按描述生成，但该项目没有自己的文件"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a substitute needs a role: what the item means (weather, clock…)"
msgstr "替代项需要角色：说明该项目是什么（天气、时钟…）"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"items of kind '%1' run code: the package must declare the 'exec' permission"
msgstr "类型为 '%1' 的项目会运行代码：软件包必须声明 'exec' 权限"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "only Plasma widgets can be shown in a window"
msgstr "只有 Plasma 小部件可以在窗口中显示"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"a Plasma widget works natively only in Plasma, so it must be optional "
"(\"required\": false)"
msgstr ""
"Plasma 小部件只能在 Plasma 中原生运行，因此必须为可选（\"required\": false）"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"a Plasma widget needs a substitute for other desktops (for example a Conky "
"widget)"
msgstr "Plasma 小部件需要为其他桌面提供替代项（例如 Conky 小部件）"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"a widget with the role '%1' only makes sense inside Plasma and cannot be "
"shown in a window"
msgstr "角色为 '%1' 的小部件只在 Plasma 中有意义，无法在窗口中显示"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "list at least one session type: x11 or wayland"
msgstr "请至少列出一种会话类型：x11 或 wayland"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the minimum size must be above zero"
msgstr "最小尺寸必须大于零"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the window size must be positive and not smaller than the minimum size"
msgstr "窗口尺寸必须为正数，且不小于最小尺寸"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "'%1' is not a valid component name"
msgstr "'%1' 不是有效的组件名称"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"compositor configuration files are never taken from a package: Rexon writes "
"its own from the description"
msgstr "合成器配置文件绝不从软件包中获取：Rexon 会根据描述自行写入"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a dependency needs a role"
msgstr "依赖需要角色"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"only a repository dependency can have a fallback, and only to AUR: "
"\"fallback\": [\"aur\"]"
msgstr ""
"只有软件仓库依赖可以设置备选来源，且只能是 AUR：\"fallback\": [\"aur\"]"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"a repository dependency needs package names for at least one distribution "
"family"
msgstr "软件仓库依赖需要至少为一个发行版系列提供软件包名称"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "an AUR fallback needs package names under \"aur\""
msgstr "AUR 备选来源需要在 \"aur\" 下提供软件包名称"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "AUR packages go into a separate dependency with \"source\": \"aur\""
msgstr "AUR 软件包应放入单独的依赖，并设置 \"source\": \"aur\""

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "unknown distribution family '%1'"
msgstr "未知的发行版系列 '%1'"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "an AUR dependency needs package names"
msgstr "AUR 依赖需要软件包名称"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "an AUR dependency lists its packages under \"aur\" only"
msgstr "AUR 依赖只能在 \"aur\" 下列出其软件包"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a GNOME extension dependency needs the extension uuid (name@author)"
msgstr "GNOME 扩展依赖需要扩展的 uuid（名称@作者）"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "a GNOME extension dependency has no package names, only the uuid"
msgstr "GNOME 扩展依赖没有软件包名称，只有 uuid"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "uuid is only for dependencies from extensions.gnome.org"
msgstr "uuid 仅用于来自 extensions.gnome.org 的依赖"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "'%1' is not a package name"
msgstr "'%1' 不是软件包名称"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "expected a list of package names or null"
msgstr "应为软件包名称列表或 null"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the Workshop item id cannot be 0"
msgstr "创意工坊物品 id 不能为 0"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Workshop tag '%1' must be 1–255 characters without commas"
msgstr "创意工坊标签 '%1' 必须为 1–255 个字符且不含逗号"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the theme bundle lists no parts Rexon knows"
msgstr "主题包中没有任何 Rexon 能识别的部分"

#. TRANSLATORS: card mark — Rexon built this part itself and it matches the design.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Made by Rexon: exact"
msgstr "由 Rexon 制作：精确"

#. TRANSLATORS: card mark — Rexon built this part itself, close to the design.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Made by Rexon: approximate"
msgstr "由 Rexon 制作：近似"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"The package has no version of this part for your desktop and nothing to "
"build one from."
msgstr "软件包中没有适用于你的桌面的此部分版本，也没有可用于构建的内容。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"The author only allows their own versions of this part, and none of them is "
"for your desktop."
msgstr "作者只允许使用其自制的此部分版本，但其中没有适用于你的桌面的版本。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Rexon can't build this part for your desktop yet."
msgstr "Rexon 暂时无法为你的桌面构建此部分。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Package %1 did not get installed."
msgstr "软件包 %1 未能安装。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"Package %1 was replaced by %2 from another source — Rexon does not accept "
"substitutes."
msgstr "软件包 %1 被来自其他来源的 %2 替换——Rexon 不接受替代品。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Installing pulled in %1, which this package must not bring along."
msgstr "安装时连带安装了 %1，而此软件包不应带入它。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the SVG image contains scripts or links to the internet"
msgstr "SVG 图像包含脚本或指向互联网的链接"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"the file runs code (%1), but its item does not declare the 'exec' permission"
msgstr "该文件会运行代码（%1），但其所属项目未声明 'exec' 权限"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Conky widget settings"
msgstr "Conky 小部件设置"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Lua script"
msgstr "Lua 脚本"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "web page with scripts"
msgstr "含脚本的网页"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "QML"
msgstr "QML"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "shortcut that runs a command"
msgstr "运行命令的快捷方式"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "script"
msgstr "脚本"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "program"
msgstr "程序"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"'%1' is not under a free license, so a derived package cannot be made from it"
msgstr "'%1' 并非采用自由许可证，因此不能基于它制作衍生软件包"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the package is derived from '%1' and must keep its license %2"
msgstr "该软件包基于 '%1' 制作，必须保留其许可证 %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "'%1' has no license, so Rexon cannot make a derived package from it."
msgstr "'%1' 没有许可证，因此 Rexon 无法基于它制作衍生软件包。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"The license of '%1' does not allow derived works to be shared, so Rexon "
"cannot make a derived package from it."
msgstr "'%1' 的许可证不允许分享衍生作品，因此 Rexon 无法基于它制作衍生软件包。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "%1 has no license: it can be installed here, but not shared"
msgstr "%1 没有许可证：可以在此安装，但不能分享"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is licensed for non-commercial use only — the Workshop does not allow that"
msgstr "%1 的许可证仅允许非商业使用——创意工坊不允许这种许可"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "%1 forbids changes (ND) — Rexon does not share such content"
msgstr "%1 禁止修改（ND）——Rexon 不分享此类内容"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "%1 is not free to share"
msgstr "%1 不可自由分享"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon does not know the license %1 of %2 and cannot tell whether it allows "
"sharing"
msgstr "Rexon 不了解 %2 的许可证 %1，无法判断其是否允许分享"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "The package"
msgstr "该软件包"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid ""
"'%1' is downloaded during installation — a shared package must contain its "
"files"
msgstr "'%1' 在安装时才下载——要分享的软件包必须自带其文件"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "path to your home folder"
msgstr "主文件夹路径"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "your user name"
msgstr "你的用户名"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "the computer name"
msgstr "计算机名"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "email address"
msgstr "电子邮件地址"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "password or mail login"
msgstr "密码或邮箱登录名"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "access key of an online service"
msgstr "在线服务的访问密钥"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "location coordinates"
msgstr "位置坐标"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "Wi-Fi network name"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 网络名称"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name (thin dark horizontal lines over the picture, like an old monitor).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "扫描线"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name: looks like an old cathode-ray tube TV/monitor.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "CRT screen"
msgstr "CRT 显像管"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name: old monochrome monitor with green phosphor.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Green monitor"
msgstr "绿色显示器"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name: old monochrome monitor with amber phosphor.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Amber monitor"
msgstr "琥珀色显示器"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name: looks like a worn video cassette.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "VHS tape"
msgstr "VHS 录像带"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name: looks like an analog TV signal (blurry colors, rainbow edges).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Analog TV"
msgstr "模拟电视"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name: looks like an old film print (grain, flicker, scratches).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Film"
msgstr "胶片"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effect preset name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Black and white"
msgstr "黑白"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for GNOME.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Works on the whole screen through Rexon's own GNOME Shell extension."
msgstr "通过 Rexon 自带的 GNOME Shell 扩展作用于整个屏幕。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Cinnamon.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Works on the whole screen through Rexon's own Cinnamon extension."
msgstr "通过 Rexon 自带的 Cinnamon 扩展作用于整个屏幕。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Hyprland. "Speed 0" refers to the speed slider.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Works on the whole screen through the Hyprland screen shader. Moving effects "
"make Hyprland redraw the whole screen every frame, which noticeably loads "
"the graphics card; at speed 0 the effect stays still and costs almost "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"通过 Hyprland 屏幕着色器作用于整个屏幕。动态特效会让 Hyprland 每帧重绘整个屏"
"幕，显著增加显卡负载；速度为 0 时特效保持静止，几乎没有开销。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for KDE Plasma.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"KWin applies the effect to each window separately, not to the whole screen: "
"screen curvature and darkened corners are left out, and moving effects stay "
"still. Black and white is also available through Plasma's own color filter."
msgstr ""
"KWin 会将特效分别应用到每个窗口，而不是整个屏幕：没有屏幕弯曲和暗角效果，动态"
"特效保持静止。黑白效果也可通过 Plasma 自带的颜色滤镜实现。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for MATE, Xfce, LXQt on X11. picom is a program name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Works on each window separately through picom, which replaces the desktop's "
"built-in compositor: screen curvature and darkened corners are left out."
msgstr ""
"通过 picom 分别作用于每个窗口，picom 将替代桌面内置的合成器：没有屏幕弯曲和暗"
"角效果。"

#. TRANSLATORS: What must be installed for screen effects on MATE/Xfce/LXQt. picom is a program name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "picom instead of the built-in compositor"
msgstr "用 picom 替代内置合成器"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Wayfire. "filters" is a plugin name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Works on the whole screen through the filters plugin. Wayfire gives effects "
"no clock, so moving effects stay still."
msgstr ""
"通过 filters 插件作用于整个屏幕。Wayfire 不向特效提供时钟，因此动态特效保持静"
"止。"

#. TRANSLATORS: What must be installed for screen effects on Wayfire. "filters" is a plugin name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "the filters plugin for Wayfire (from the AUR)"
msgstr "Wayfire 的 filters 插件（来自 AUR）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Pantheon.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Pantheon can't add effects to the screen; only its own black and white "
"filter is available."
msgstr "Pantheon 无法为屏幕添加特效；只能使用其自带的黑白滤镜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for COSMIC.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"COSMIC can't add effects to the screen; only its own black and white filter "
"is available."
msgstr "COSMIC 无法为屏幕添加特效；只能使用其自带的黑白滤镜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for sway, river, labwc.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "This compositor has no way to apply effects to the screen."
msgstr "此合成器无法为屏幕应用特效。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for niri.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"niri doesn't support screen effects yet (requested from its developers)."
msgstr "niri 暂不支持屏幕特效（已向其开发者提出请求）。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Budgie.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Budgie has no way to add effects to the screen."
msgstr "Budgie 无法为屏幕添加特效。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Deepin's Treeland (Wayland session).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Treeland has no way to apply effects to the screen."
msgstr "Treeland 无法为屏幕应用特效。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for an X11-only desktop started in a Wayland session.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Screen effects here work only in an X11 session."
msgstr "此处的屏幕特效仅在 X11 会话中可用。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for a desktop Rexon doesn't know.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Rexon doesn't know how to add screen effects on this desktop."
msgstr "Rexon 不知道如何在此桌面上添加屏幕特效。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"The Rexon shell extension is left over from an older version and doesn't "
"know screen effects yet. Reinstall it in “%1” and try again."
msgstr "Rexon 外壳扩展来自旧版本，尚不支持屏幕特效。请在“%1”中重新安装后重试。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"The Rexon shell extension isn't running in this session, so screen effects "
"can't be shown. Log out and back in; if that doesn't help, reinstall it in "
"“%1”."
msgstr ""
"Rexon 外壳扩展未在此会话中运行，因此无法显示屏幕特效。请注销后重新登录；如果"
"仍无效，请在“%1”中重新安装。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects on KDE Plasma: the person already uses Plasma's color filter for color blindness. "System Settings → Accessibility" is the KDE place, keep it as KDE translates it; arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma's color filter is already in use for color blindness correction. "
"Rexon won't replace it: turn it off in System Settings → Accessibility first."
msgstr ""
"Plasma 的颜色滤镜已用于色盲校正。Rexon 不会替换它：请先在“系统设置 → 无障碍辅"
"助”中将其关闭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Toast after screen effects were changed on COSMIC, which reads the setting only at login.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "COSMIC will apply this the next time you log in."
msgstr "COSMIC 将在您下次登录时应用此设置。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Toast after screen effects were changed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Screen effects applied."
msgstr "已应用屏幕特效。"

