msgstr "按住窗口菜单按钮可显示菜单。"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/window_buttons.rs
msgid ""
"When off, the button appears only while the window is hidden from "
"screenshots and screen recordings."
msgstr "关闭时，该按钮只在窗口被隐藏于截图和录屏时出现。"

